msgstr "**Transpilirajte dodatne pakete InstUI**"

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/next` — a Next.js config adapter."
msgstr "`@pantoken/next` — adapter konfiguracije za Next.js."

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure UI ships ESM packages that Next must transpile (`transpilePackages`), the #1 papercut\nwhen running InstUI on Next. `withPantoken` merges the InstUI packages into that list. Wrap your\n`next.config`, then import `@pantoken/css` in your root layout for the tokens."
msgstr "Instructure UI dostavlja ESM pakete, ki jih Next mora prevesti (`transpilePackages`), največja nadloga\npri zagonu InstUI na Next. `withPantoken` združi pakete InstUI v ta seznam. Ovijte vaš\n`next.config`, nato uvozite `@pantoken/css` v vaš root layout za tokene."

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [withPantoken](functions/withPantoken.md)"
msgstr "Preimenuje in ponovno izvaža [withPantoken](functions/withPantoken.md)"

