#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-kit` — build and compose pantoken plugins, with capability-aware registration."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-kit` — izdelava in sestavljanje pantoken vtičnikov z registracijo, ki upošteva zmogljivosti."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) is the modern factory: pass the hooks you implement and it returns a normal\n`PantokenPlugin` branded with the capabilities inferred from those hooks. Consumers\n(`buildTokens`, `toCss`) run [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md) to warn — never error — when a plugin is\nregistered where it has no effect: a non-factoried plugin (capability checks unavailable) or a\nfactoried plugin at a stage it doesn't implement (e.g. a token-only plugin passed to `toCss`)."
msgstr "[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) je sodobna tovarna: podajte kuke, ki jih implementirate, in vrne običajen\n`PantokenPlugin` označen z zmogljivostmi, izpeljanimi iz teh kuk. Porabniki\n(`buildTokens`, `toCss`) za opozarjanje — nikoli za napako — uporabljajo [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md), kadar je vtičnik\nregistriran tam, kjer nima učinka: vtičnik brez uporabe tovarne (preverjanja zmogljivosti niso na voljo) ali\ntovarna vtičnika za fazo, ki je ne implementira (npr. vtičnik samo za tokene poslan v `toCss`)."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transform stages a `plugins:` array actually drives are `tokens`, `icons`, and `css`; `rehype`\n(a render-time icon resolver) and `native` (Style Dictionary) are recorded as capabilities but are\ndownstream consumers, not guarded here."
msgstr "Faze transformacije, ki jih dejansko poganja polje `plugins:`, so `tokens`, `icons` in `css`; `rehype`\n(rešilec ikon v času upodabljanja) in `native` (Style Dictionary) sta zabeležena kot zmogljivosti, vendar sta\nspodaj le porabnika, ne pa zaščitena tukaj."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
