#: packages/utils/src/functions/colorUtilitiesCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the semantic-colour utility stylesheet: `.<prefix>-bg-<name>` (background),\n`.<prefix>-text-<name>` (text colour), `.<prefix>-border-<name>` (border colour), one per semantic\ncolour token. `.<prefix>-color-<name>` is emitted alongside `.<prefix>-text-<name>` as an alias — same\ndeclaration, either class name works. Overrides are therefore only ever token-valid — no primitives,\nno arbitrary hex. Pass the token names per family (e.g. from `@pantoken/tokens`), or an explicit\n`[name, token]` pair to source a name from a different token than the family's own scale."
msgstr "Build the semantic-colour utility stylesheet: `.&lt;prefix&gt;-bg-&lt;name&gt;` (background),\n`.&lt;prefix&gt;-text-&lt;name&gt;` (text colour), `.&lt;prefix&gt;-border-&lt;name&gt;` (border colour), one per semantic\ncolour token. `.&lt;prefix&gt;-color-&lt;name&gt;` is emitted alongside `.&lt;prefix&gt;-text-&lt;name&gt;` as an alias — same\ndeclaration, either class name works. Overrides are therefore only ever token-valid — no primitives,\nno arbitrary hex. Pass the token names per family (e.g. from `@pantoken/tokens`), or an explicit\n`[name, token]` pair to source a name from a different token than the family's own scale."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/danglingReferences.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Self-containment check: `--instui-*` names referenced via `var()` in a stylesheet that it never\ndefines (as an `@property` registration or a `--x:` declaration). Sorted; empty means every\nreference resolves within the same output. Use for self-contained stylesheets (css, pendo)."
msgstr "Preverjanje samostojnosti: `--instui-*` imena, na katera se sklicuje preko `var()` v stylesheetu, ki jih nikoli ne definira (kot registracijo `@property` ali deklaracijo `--x:`). Razvrščeno; prazno pomeni, da se vsak sklic razreši znotraj istega izhoda. Uporabno za samostojne slogovne datoteke (css, pendo)."

