#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Defense-in-depth for SVG decoded from vendored data URIs or contributed by plugins.\nNot a full HTML parser — relies on the upstream source being trusted and pinned."
msgstr "Večplastna obramba za SVG, razkodiran iz vključenih data URI-jev ali prispevan s strani vtičnikov.\nNi popoln HTML-parser — temelji na tem, da je izvirni (upstream) vir zaupan in zasidran."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/tokenNames.md
