msgstr "Nabor tokenov, ki se vsi preslikajo na eno CSS lastnost (npr. vsak `--instui-font-weight-*` → `font-weight`)."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md
#, no-c-format
