msgstr "Število točk svetlosti za dodati (privzeto `10`, kar ustreza privzetim nastavitvam tinycolor)."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The readable foreground — black or white — for content placed *on* `surface`. This is the CSS-only\nform of InstUI's recurring `*-on-color` variants (a focus ring on a brand button, a\nprimary-inverse button's text, an icon on a coloured surface): rather than a fixed inverse token,\nit picks the contrast from the surface itself, so it stays correct as the surface changes."
msgstr "Berljiv sprednji načrt — črna ali bela — za vsebino, postavljeno *na* `surface`. To je izključno CSS različica ponavljajočih se `*-on-color` različic InstUI (obroč za fokus na gumbu znamke,\nbesedilo primarno-inverznega gumba, ikona na obarvani površini): namesto fiksnega inverznega tokena,\nizbere kontrast iz same površine, tako da ostane pravilen, ko se površina spreminja."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It reads the surface's OKLCH lightness through relative color syntax and snaps it to `0` (black) or\n`1` (white) at `threshold` using the `calc(… * infinity)` clamp trick — no JS, no fixed hex."
msgstr "Prebere svetlost površine v OKLCH prek sintakse relativnih barv in jo pri `threshold` privije na `0` (črna) ali\n`1` (bela) z uporabo trika `calc(… * infinity)` clamp — brez JS, brez fiksnega hex."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The background colour content sits on (literal, `var(--token)`, or a nested helper)."
msgstr "Barva ozadja, na kateri počiva vsebina (dobesedna, `var(--token)` ali gnezdena pomožna vrednost)."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "OKLCH lightness (0–1) above which the surface counts as \"light\" (default `0.62`)."
msgstr "Svetlost OKLCH (0–1), nad katero se površina šteje za \"svetlo\" (privzeto `0.62`)."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An `oklch(from …)` expression resolving to black or white."
msgstr "Izraz `oklch(from …)`, ki se razreši v črno ali belo."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Flatten `overlay` (at `percent`% strength) over an opaque `base` — a CSS-only stand-in for\nui-color-utils `overlayColors`. That helper source-over-composites two RGBA colors into one opaque\nresult; the common case (a translucent tint over a solid surface) is exactly a two-color\n`color-mix()`. General RGBA-over-RGBA compositing can't be a single CSS color, so this covers the\nopaque-base case only."
msgstr "Splošči `overlay` (pri `percent` % jakosti) nad neprosojnim `base` — samo-CSS nadomestek za\nui-color-utils `overlayColors`. Ta pomočnik z načelom source-over združi dve RGBA barvi v eno neprosojno\nrezultato; pogost primer (prosojen odtenek nad trdno površino) je natanko dvobarvni\n`color-mix()`. Splošno kompozitiranje RGBA nad RGBA ne more biti ena sama CSS barva, zato to zajema le\nprimer z neprosojno podlago."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The opaque background color."
msgstr "Neprosojna barva ozadja."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The color laid over it."
msgstr "Barva, ki je nanesena čeznjo."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "How much of `overlay` shows through, 0–100 (default `50`)."
msgstr "Koliko `overlay` prepušča, 0–100 (privzeto `50`)."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-colors` — CSS-only color math that mirrors the InstUI `@instructure/ui-color-utils`\nhelpers (`alpha`, `darken`, `lighten`, `overlayColors`)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-colors` — izključno CSS-barvna matematika, ki zrcali InstUI `@instructure/ui-color-utils`\npomočnike (`alpha`, `darken`, `lighten`, `overlayColors`)."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "InstUI computes those at build time with `tinycolor2` against concrete hex values. pantoken emits\n`var(--instui-*)` references that resolve in the browser (often through `light-dark()`), so the\nmath has to happen in CSS instead. Each helper returns a CSS color string built from\n[`color-mix()`](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/color_value/color-mix) and\n[relative color syntax](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_colors/Relative_colors) —\nboth Baseline modern-browser features — so a single expression tracks the token even when it's a\nscheme-dependent `light-dark()` pair. Use them wherever you'd otherwise hard-code a derived shade."
msgstr "InstUI jih izračuna ob času sestave z uporabo `tinycolor2` na konkretnih heks vrednostih. pantoken izda\n`var(--instui-*)` reference, ki se razrešijo v brskalniku (pogosto preko `light-dark()`), zato mora biti\nmatematika izvedena v CSS‑u. Vsak pripomoček vrne CSS niz barve, sestavljen iz\n[`color-mix()`](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/color_value/color-mix) in\n[relativne barvne sintakse](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_colors/Relative_colors) —\noba sta sodobni funkciji osnovnih brskalnikov — tako ena sama izražba sledi tokenu tudi, ko gre za\npar `light-dark()`, odvisen od sheme. Uporabljajte jih kjerkoli bi sicer trdo kodirali izpeljan odtenek."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/type-aliases/CssColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CSS color: a literal (`#1d354f`, `rebeccapurple`), a `var(--token)`, or a nested helper result."
msgstr "CSS barva: literal (`#1d354f`, `rebeccapurple`), `var(--token)` ali rezultat gnezdenega pomočnega izraza."

