#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-deprecations` — lifecycle-aware compatibility shims for dropped upstream tokens."
msgstr "@pantoken/plugin-deprecations — kompatibilnostne prilagoditve, ki upoštevajo življenjski cikel, za odstranjene upstream tokene."

#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When an upstream release drops a `--instui-*` token, a hand-authored `DeprecationLedger`\nrecords its lifecycle: when it was deprecated, the upstream minor that will remove it, and how to\nkeep it working meanwhile — either forward to a canonical token (`replacement` → `var(...)`) or\nfreeze its last-known literal (`value`). This plugin appends one shim token per entry. Because the\nshim is a single `var(...)` or a plain value, `defineToken` records its `refersTo`/syntax and\n`toCss` emits it, so the shim rides into css/scss/less/stylus/wordpress/vanilla with no extra wiring."
msgstr "Ko nadrejena izdaja odstrani `--instui-*` token, ročno napisan `DeprecationLedger` zabeleži njegov življenjski cikel: kdaj je bil označen kot zastarel, kateri upstream minor ga bo odstranil, in kako ga vmes ohraniti delujočega — bodisi preusmeritev na kanonični token (`replacement` → `var(...)`) ali zamrznitev njegovega zadnje znanega literala (`value`). Ta vtičnik doda en shim token na vnos. Ker je shim en sam `var(...)` ali navadna vrednost, `defineToken` zabeleži njegov `refersTo`/sintakso in `toCss` ga izda, tako da se shim prenese v css/scss/less/stylus/wordpress/vanilla brez dodatnega vezanja."

#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The retirement is enforced elsewhere (the upgrade pipeline hard-fails a bump once an entry's\n`removeIn` upstream minor is reached, forcing the entry to be retired and a consumer minor cut).\n[dueForRemoval](functions/dueForRemoval.md) is the check that powers it; [describeLifecycle](functions/describeLifecycle.md) powers the docs."
msgstr "Upokojitev se izvaja drugje (upgrade pipeline pri povišanju različice trdo odpove, ko vnosa doseže upstream `removeIn` minor, s čimer je vnosa prisilno upokojen in izdan nov consumer minor). [dueForRemoval](functions/dueForRemoval.md) je preverjanje, ki to poganja; [describeLifecycle](functions/describeLifecycle.md) poganja dokumentacijo."

#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [deprecationShims](functions/deprecationShims.md)"
msgstr "Preimenuje in znova izvozi [deprecationShims](functions/deprecationShims.md)"

