msgstr "Vrne `true`, če ime spremenjene datoteke ustreza vključevalnim/izključevnim filtrom vozlišča."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/vite-workspace-orchestrator` — a Vite dev-server plugin that watches upstream workspace\npackages and rebuilds them (and their dependents) when source changes."
msgstr "`@pantoken/vite-workspace-orchestrator` — vtičnik za razvojni strežnik Vite, ki spremlja nadrejene pakete delovnega prostora\nin jih znova gradi (ter njihove odvisnike), ko se izvor spremeni."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "During development, changes to a local workspace package normally need a manual rebuild before the\ndev server reflects them. This plugin automates that: it watches each upstream package's source\nwith native `fs.watch` (not Vite's chokidar, which filters paths outside the project root),\ndebounces rapid changes, rebuilds in topological order, and registers built output with Vite's\nwatcher so the browser reloads. In pantoken's docs it keeps the generated CSS (`@pantoken/css`,\n`@pantoken/components`) fresh as you edit the libraries, instead of only at build time."
msgstr "Med razvojem spremembe v lokalnem paketu delovnega prostora običajno zahtevajo ročno ponovno gradnjo, preden jih\nrazvojni strežnik prikaže. Ta vtičnik to avtomatizira: spremlja izvor vsakega nadrejenega paketa z vgrajenim `fs.watch` (ne Vite-ovim chokidarjem, ki filtrira poti zunaj korena projekta),\nzgladi hitre spremembe, ponovno gradi v topološkem vrstnem redu in registrira zgrajen izhod pri Vite-ovem\nwatcherju, tako da se brskalnik osveži. V dokumentaciji pantoken ohranja generiran CSS (`@pantoken/css`,\n`@pantoken/components`) svež med urejanjem knjižnic, namesto zgolj ob gradnji."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It applies during `serve` only, so production builds are untouched."
msgstr "Uporablja se le med `serve`, zato proizvodne gradnje ostanejo nespremenjene."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/FileServerEntry.md
#, no-c-format
