msgstr "Neobvezna transformacija, ki se uporabi na URL-relativni poti pred razrešitvijo glede na `serveDir`, npr.\n`(p) => p.replace(//([^/]+)\\.css$/, \"/$1/app.css\")`."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [workspaceOrchestrator](../functions/workspaceOrchestrator.md)."
msgstr "Možnosti za [workspaceOrchestrator](../functions/workspaceOrchestrator.md)."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The upstream workspace dependency graph."
msgstr "Graf odvisnosti nadrejenega delovnega prostora."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Paths to watch with native `fs.watch` so Vite picks up built output after an upstream rebuild\n(e.g. a package's `dist` or `generated` directory). Uses native `fs.watch` rather than\nchokidar's `add()`, which doesn't reliably detect changes in pnpm-symlinked or out-of-root\ndirectories. On each change a synthetic `\"change\"` event is emitted on `server.watcher`: for\nCSS files already in the module graph Vite triggers a targeted hot-update; for anything else\nit falls back to a full page reload."
msgstr "Poti za opazovanje z uporabo izvornega `fs.watch`, tako da Vite zazna zgrajen izhod po ponovni izgradnji nadrejenega projekta\n(npr. paketova mapa `dist` ali `generated`). Uporablja izvorni `fs.watch` namesto\nchokidarjevega `add()`, ki sprememb ne zaznava zanesljivo v pnpm-simbolno-povezanih ali izven-izhodiščnih\nmapah. Ob vsaki spremembi se na `server.watcher` sproži sintetičen `\"change\"` dogodek: za\nCSS datoteke, ki so že v modulski grafu, Vite sproži ciljno vročo posodobitev; za vse drugo\nse uporabi popolno ponovno naloženje strani."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Debounce delay in milliseconds before triggering a rebuild (default: 200)."
msgstr "Zakasnitev debounce v milisekundah pred sprožitvijo ponovne izgradnje (privzeto: 200)."

