msgid "**Compose a brand-icon plugin's resolver**"
msgstr "**Sestavite resolver vtičnika brand-icon**"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — a markdown-it plugin that renders `:icon:` codes as inline SVG and\nstandalone color values (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) as swatches, using the pantoken icon\nset."
msgstr "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — vtičnik za markdown-it, ki upodobi `:icon:` kode kot vstavne SVG in\nsamostojne barvne vrednosti (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) kot vzorce, z uporabo nabora ikon pantoken."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ports the `@pantoken/rehype` and `@pantoken/react-markdown` pipelines onto markdown-it: a\nsingle core rule walks each inline token's text children, splits them on the icon and color\npatterns, and swaps the matches for `html_inline` tokens. Icon codes resolve through a chain —\nplugin `rehype` resolvers first, then an explicit [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve), then the\nbuilt-in `@pantoken/icons` set — so brand-icon plugins compose the same way they do elsewhere."
msgstr "Prenese `@pantoken/rehype` in `@pantoken/react-markdown` cevovode na markdown-it: ena sama osnovna pravila pregleda besedilne otroške vozle vsakega vstavnega tokena, jih razdeli po vzorcih ikon in barv ter zamenja ujemanja za `html_inline` tokene. Ikonske kode se rešijo skozi verigo — najprej razreševalci vtičnika `rehype`, nato izrecni [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve), nato vgrajeni `@pantoken/icons` nabor — zato se vtičniki za blagovne znamke sestavljajo na enak način kot drugod."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The emitted markup uses the same class names as the other renderers (`pantoken-icon`,\n`pantoken-color-swatch`), so loading `@pantoken/components` styles it. Wrap the rendered HTML in a\n`.pantoken-prose` container (see [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)) to pick up the prose layer too."
msgstr "Generiran HTML uporablja enaka imena razredov kot ostali upodabljalci (`pantoken-icon`,\n`pantoken-color-swatch`), zato ga naloženi `@pantoken/components` stilira. Ovij izrenderjan HTML v\n`.pantoken-prose` vsezavojnik (glej [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)), da zajame tudi prose plast."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pantokenMarkdownIt](functions/pantokenMarkdownIt.md)"
msgstr "Preimenuje in ponovno izvaža [pantokenMarkdownIt](functions/pantokenMarkdownIt.md)"

