#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/pendo` — an Instructure-styled global stylesheet for Pendo guides."
msgstr "`@pantoken/pendo` — globalna slogovna datoteka v slogu Instructure za Pendo vodnike."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs, and an `instui-banner` prefix extends the\nbanner surface to popovers and surveys while keeping their overlay elevation."
msgstr "Pendo vstavi HTML vodiča v gostiteljsko stran; to upodobi DOM tega vodiča (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. Vključuje odzivne\nviolet in sea obdelave pasic za vodiče skupaj z obvestili, pojavnimi okni, anketami in kontrolami. Komponentna\nCSS je prenešena iz `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken zagotavlja tokene in \nassembly. Ena samostojna tema z razredom, ki vsebuje `instui`, aktivira omejen slogovni list; kompaktni\npriponi na tem razredu izbirajo barve pasic in glice, in `instui-banner` predpona razširi \npovršino pasice na pojavna okna in ankete, hkrati pa ohranja njihovo prekrivno višino."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."
msgstr "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) sestavi slogovno datoteko; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) je že pripravljena `rebrand` gradnja (scoped, `!important`). Statična datoteka je objavljena na `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"
msgstr "Preimenuje in ponovno izvaža [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"

