msgstr "Koreninski selektor `@scope` (privzeto `[class*=\"instui\"]._pendo-step-container`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap component rules in `@scope` for DOM containment (default `true`)."
msgstr "Ovij pravilnike komponent v `@scope` za vsebovanje v DOM‑u (privzeto `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add `!important` to component declarations so they beat Pendo's styles (default `true`)."
msgstr "Dodaj `!important` v deklaracije komponent, da preglasijo Pendo sloge (privzeto `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens (default `true`; off ships the full token set)."
msgstr "Odstrani (tree‑shake) neuporabljene žetone `--instui-*` (privzeto `true`; izključeno pošlje celoten nabor žetonov)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property declarations via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (default `false`). `true` uses plugin defaults with\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` so the declarations land inside the `@scope` block.\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "Pretvori at‑pravila `@property` v navadne deklaracije prilagojenih lastnosti preko\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (privzeto `false`). `true` uporablja privzete nastavitve vtičnika z\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"`, tako da deklaracije pristanejo znotraj bloka `@scope`.\nPosreduj objekt [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) za preglasitev posameznih privzetih nastavitev."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mangle `--instui-*` names to minimal base-26 identifiers via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(default `false`). Safe here because the full token + component stylesheet is a\nself-contained bundle. Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override defaults."
msgstr "Skrajšaj imena `--instui-*` v minimalne identifikatorje v bazi‑26 preko [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(privzeto `false`). Tukaj je varno, ker sta celoten nabor žetonov in slogovna datoteka komponent\nsamo‑vsebuječ paket. Posreduj objekt [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) za preglasitev privzetih nastavitev."

#: renderers/pendo/src/variables/COMPONENTS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The component CSS in cascade order (the `tokens` and `vars` layers are handled separately)."
msgstr "Komponentni CSS v vrstnem redu kaskade (plasti `tokens` in `vars` se obravnavajo ločeno)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/variables/LAYER_ORDER.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Cascade order (lowest → highest). Layered `!important` beats Pendo's\nown unlayered `!important`, so guide styles stay on top."
msgstr "Redosled kaskade (najnižji → najvišji). Plasten `!important` premaga Pendojev\nlastni neplasten `!important`, tako da slogi vodnikov ostanejo na vrhu."

