msgstr "Izberite token objekt za barvno shemo (združite z RN-ovim `useColorScheme`)."

#: renderers/react-native/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/react-native` — Instructure design tokens as React Native `StyleSheet`-friendly\nobjects. React Native has no CSS variables, so tokens are fully resolved to concrete values:\ncolours stay hex strings, dimensions become numbers (dp), and icons are excluded."
msgstr "`@pantoken/react-native` — Instructure oblikovni tokeni kot React Native `StyleSheet`-prijazni\nobjekti. React Native nima CSS-spremenljivk, zato so tokeni popolnoma razrešeni v konkretne vrednosti:\nbarve ostanejo heksadecimalni nizi, dimenzije postanejo številke (dp), in ikone so izključene."

#: renderers/react-native/src/type-aliases/RNTokenValue.md
#, no-c-format
