#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/pages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-pages>` — shows one slotted `[data-page]` panel at a time, swapping with the View\nTransitions API when available (a plain toggle otherwise). `push(id)`/`back()` keep a history\nstack; the `active` attribute reflects the current page and can be set to navigate, and a bubbling\n`change` event (`detail.page`) fires per swap. Drivable from light DOM via Invoker Commands:\n`<button command=\"--push\" commandfor=\"pages-id\" data-page=\"…\">` and\n`<button command=\"--back\" commandfor=\"pages-id\">`."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-pages&gt;` — shows one slotted `[data-page]` panel at a time, swapping with the View\nTransitions API when available (a plain toggle otherwise). `push(id)`/`back()` keep a history\nstack; the `active` attribute reflects the current page and can be set to navigate, and a bubbling\n`change` event (`detail.page`) fires per swap. Drivable from light DOM via Invoker Commands:\n`<button command=\"--push\" commandfor=\"pages-id\" data-page=\"…\">` and\n`<button command=\"--back\" commandfor=\"pages-id\">`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-pill>` — a compact status pill. The `variant` attribute maps to the `-color-<variant>`\nmodifier; slotted content is the label."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-pill&gt;` — a compact status pill. The `variant` attribute maps to the `-color-&lt;variant&gt;`\nmodifier; slotted content is the label."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/pl.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Polish (Polski) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paket lokalizacije za poljski jezik (Polski)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-popover>` — a floating surface. Like `<instui-context-view>`, the host is a native\n`[popover]` (top layer + light-dismiss), so a light-DOM `popovertarget` button can toggle it by id.\nContent goes in the default slot."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-popover&gt;` — a floating surface. Like `&lt;instui-context-view&gt;`, the host is a native\n`[popover]` (top layer + light-dismiss), so a light-DOM `popovertarget` button can toggle it by id.\nContent goes in the default slot."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-progress>` — a horizontal indicator backed by native `<progress>` or `<meter>` semantics."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-progress&gt;` — a horizontal indicator backed by native `&lt;progress&gt;` or `&lt;meter&gt;` semantics."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `<progress>`; a non-zero minimum renders `<meter>`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to transition meter changes over half a second. `variant` maps the\ncomponent to `-color-<variant>` and `label` supplies its accessible name."
msgstr "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `&lt;progress&gt;`; a non-zero minimum renders `&lt;meter&gt;`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to transition meter changes over half a second. `variant` maps the\ncomponent to `-color-&lt;variant&gt;` and `label` supplies its accessible name."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-progress-circle>` — a circular indicator backed by native `<progress>` or `<meter>` semantics."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-progress-circle&gt;` — a circular indicator backed by native `&lt;progress&gt;` or `&lt;meter&gt;` semantics."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `<progress>`; a non-zero minimum renders `<meter>`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to animate from zero on mount; `animation-delay` is a millisecond delay.\n`label` overrides the accessible name (which otherwise defaults to the percentage)."
msgstr "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `&lt;progress&gt;`; a non-zero minimum renders `&lt;meter&gt;`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to animate from zero on mount; `animation-delay` is a millisecond delay.\n`label` overrides the accessible name (which otherwise defaults to the percentage)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/pt.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Portuguese (Português) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paket lokalizacije za portugalščino (Português)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ptBR.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Portuguese Brazil (Português do Brasil) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paket lokalizacije za brazilsko portugalščino (Português do Brasil)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-rating>` — a star rating with `role=\"img\"`. `value` is the number of filled stars, `max`\nthe total (default 5), and `label` overrides the accessible name (defaults to `value/max`). Stars\nrender as inline SVG glyphs (solid = filled), sized to the text."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-rating&gt;` — a star rating with `role=\"img\"`. `value` is the number of filled stars, `max`\nthe total (default 5), and `label` overrides the accessible name (defaults to `value/max`). Stars\nrender as inline SVG glyphs (solid = filled), sized to the text."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ru.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Russian (Русский) locale bundle."
msgstr "Ruski (Русский) paket lokalizacije."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/se.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Northern Sami locale bundle."
msgstr "Paket lokalizacije za severni sami."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/sideNavBar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-side-nav-bar>` — the styled shell of a vertical navigation rail. `minimized=\"true\"` adds\nthe `-minimized` modifier (collapsed rail); the consumer slots the nav items."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-side-nav-bar&gt;` — the styled shell of a vertical navigation rail. `minimized=\"true\"` adds\nthe `-minimized` modifier (collapsed rail); the consumer slots the nav items."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/sl.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Slovenian (Slovenščina) locale bundle."
msgstr "Lokalizacijski paket za slovenščino (Slovenščina)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-spinner>` — a loading spinner with `role=\"status\"`. Purely presentational; size and\ncolour follow the CSS tokens."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-spinner&gt;` — a loading spinner with `role=\"status\"`. Purely presentational; size and\ncolour follow the CSS tokens."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/sv.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Swedish (Svenska) locale bundle."
msgstr "Švedski (Svenska) paket lokalizacije."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-tag>` — a token-styled tag/chip. Slotted content is the label."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-tag&gt;` — a token-styled tag/chip. Slotted content is the label."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/th.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Thai (ไทย) locale bundle."
msgstr "Tajski (ไทย) jezikovni paket."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/toggleButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-toggle-button>` — a two-state button. `pressed=\"true\"` reflects to the button's\n`aria-pressed`; slotted content is the label."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-toggle-button&gt;` — a two-state button. `pressed=\"true\"` reflects to the button's\n`aria-pressed`; slotted content is the label."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-tooltip>` — wraps a slotted trigger and shows a `.tip` bubble (from the `tip` attribute)\non hover/focus. `placement` maps to `-placement-<value>` (e.g. `bottom`, `end`); `show-delay` and\n`hide-delay` (ms, default 0) gate the reveal/hide, and Escape dismisses it. JS owns the timing:\na `.-show`-gated `!important` override neutralizes the pure-CSS `:hover`/`:focus-within` auto-show\nso the delay actually applies."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-tooltip&gt;` — wraps a slotted trigger and shows a `.tip` bubble (from the `tip` attribute)\non hover/focus. `placement` maps to `-placement-&lt;value&gt;` (e.g. `bottom`, `end`); `show-delay` and\n`hide-delay` (ms, default 0) gate the reveal/hide, and Escape dismisses it. JS owns the timing:\na `.-show`-gated `!important` override neutralizes the pure-CSS `:hover`/`:focus-within` auto-show\nso the delay actually applies."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tr.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Turkish (Türkçe) locale bundle."
msgstr "Turski (Türkçe) paket lokalizacije."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-tray>` — a panel docked to a viewport edge, backed by a native `[popover]` (top layer +\nlight-dismiss). `placement` maps to `-placement-<value>` (e.g. `start`, `end`, `top`, `bottom`) and\n`size` to `-size-<value>`; a light-DOM `popovertarget` button toggles it by id. Content goes in the\ndefault slot."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-tray&gt;` — a panel docked to a viewport edge, backed by a native `[popover]` (top layer +\nlight-dismiss). `placement` maps to `-placement-&lt;value&gt;` (e.g. `start`, `end`, `top`, `bottom`) and\n`size` to `-size-&lt;value&gt;`; a light-DOM `popovertarget` button toggles it by id. Content goes in the\ndefault slot."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/treeBrowser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-tree-browser>` — the styled shell of a collapsible tree, with `role=\"tree\"`. The consumer\nslots the tree markup."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-tree-browser&gt;` — the styled shell of a collapsible tree, with `role=\"tree\"`. The consumer\nslots the tree markup."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-truncate>` — clamps slotted text to a fixed number of lines with an ellipsis. `lines`\naccepts a positive integer or `auto`. A number sets the `--lines` custom property directly.\n`auto` computes a line count from the host's available height and applies that as `--lines`.\nOmit `lines` for single-line truncation."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-truncate&gt;` — clamps slotted text to a fixed number of lines with an ellipsis. `lines`\naccepts a positive integer or `auto`. A number sets the `--lines` custom property directly.\n`auto` computes a line count from the host's available height and applies that as `--lines`.\nOmit `lines` for single-line truncation."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/uk.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Ukrainian (Українська) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paket lokalizacije za ukrajinščino (Українська)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/vi.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Vietnamese locale bundle."
msgstr "Vietnamski paket lokalizacije."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/zhHans.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Simplified Chinese (简体中文) locale bundle."
msgstr "Jezikovni paket za poenostavljeno kitajščino (简体中文)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/zhHant.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
