msgstr "Paket lokalizacije za tradicionalno kitajščino (繁體中文)."

#: tools/aggregate/src/functions/aggregate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Generate the meta package's source barrel, subpath entries, and `exports` map."
msgstr "Ustvari izvorni barrel meta paketa, vnose podpoti in preslikavo `exports`."

#: tools/aggregate/src/functions/aggregate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The discovered targets."
msgstr "Odkriti cilji."

#: tools/aggregate/src/functions/aggregate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Regenerate the meta package**"
msgstr "**Ponovno ustvari meta paket**"

#: tools/aggregate/src/functions/discoverTargets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Read the `pantoken` targets from the meta package's dependencies."
msgstr "Preberi cilje `pantoken` iz odvisnosti meta paketa."

#: tools/aggregate/src/functions/discoverTargets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Inspect what would be aggregated, without writing anything**"
msgstr "**Preveri, kaj bi bilo združeno, ne da bi karkoli zapisal**"

#: tools/aggregate/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The aggregator for the unified `pantoken` meta package. It scans the meta package's dependencies\nfor the `pantoken` field, then generates the barrel (`export * as <key> from \"<pkg>\"`), one\nsubpath entry file per target, and the meta `package.json` `exports` map — so adding a new target\npackage with a `pantoken` field auto-registers it, with no manual barrel edits."
msgstr "The aggregator for the unified `pantoken` meta package. It scans the meta package's dependencies\nfor the `pantoken` field, then generates the barrel (`export * as &lt;key&gt; from \"&lt;pkg&gt;\"`), one\nsubpath entry file per target, and the meta `package.json` `exports` map — so adding a new target\npackage with a `pantoken` field auto-registers it, with no manual barrel edits."

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/AggregateOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [aggregate](../functions/aggregate.md)."
msgstr "Možnosti za [aggregate](../functions/aggregate.md)."

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/AggregateOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The meta package directory (contains `package.json` and `src/`)."
msgstr "Direktorij meta paketa (vsebuje `package.json` in `src/`)."

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A target discovered by its `pantoken` field."
msgstr "Cilj, najden po svojem polju `pantoken`."

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The package name, e.g. `@pantoken/astro`."
msgstr "Ime paketa, npr. `@pantoken/astro`."

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The aggregation key / export name, e.g. `astro`."
msgstr "Ključ agregacije / ime izvoza, npr. `astro`."

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "How the target is exposed:\n- `namespace` — re-exported into the eager barrel *and* as a subpath.\n- `sideEffect` — subpath imports the package's `/inject` entry; also in the barrel.\n- `subpath` — subpath only, kept OUT of the eager barrel (for heavy peers like React, so\n  `import \"pantoken\"` never loads them)."
msgstr "Kako je cilj izpostavljen:\n- `namespace` — ponovno izvožen v eager barrel *in* kot podpot.\n- `sideEffect` — podpot uvozi vnos `/inject` paketa; prav tako je v barrelu.\n- `subpath` — samo podpot, ohranjeno IZVEN eager barrel-a (za težke peerje, kot je React, tako da\n  `import \"pantoken\"` jih nikoli ne naloži)."

#: tools/demo/src/functions/buildExampleSrcdoc.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the full `<!doctype html>` document string for an isolated live-example preview."
msgstr "Sestavite celoten niz dokumenta `<!doctype html>` za izoliran predogled živega primera."

#: tools/demo/src/functions/buildExampleSrcdoc.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The example's raw markup (verbatim from its source fence)."
msgstr "Surova označevalna koda primera (do besedila, dobesedno iz njegove izvorne ograje)."

#: tools/demo/src/functions/buildExampleSrcdoc.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The document string — pass it through [escapeSrcdoc](escapeSrcdoc.md) before using it as an iframe\n`srcdoc` attribute value."
msgstr "Niz dokumenta — pred uporabo kot vrednost atributa iframe [escapeSrcdoc](escapeSrcdoc.md) potrdite skozi escapeSrcdoc\n`srcdoc`."

#: tools/demo/src/functions/demoMarkdownIt.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A markdown-it plugin: turn `demo` fences into the demo panel. Use it with\n`md.use(demoMarkdownIt, options)`."
msgstr "Vtičnik za markdown-it: spremeni ograje `demo` v demo ploščo. Uporabite ga z\n`md.use(demoMarkdownIt, options)`."

#: tools/demo/src/functions/escapeSrcdoc.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Escape a string for embedding inside an HTML attribute value delimited by `\"`."
msgstr "Umaknite posebne znake v nizu, da ga je mogoče vstaviti v vrednost HTML atributa, ki jo omejuje `\"`."

#: tools/demo/src/functions/renderDemoFigure.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render the demo panel HTML for a resolved demo: a bare, sandboxed, lazy-loaded iframe framed like a\nlive example (no host chrome — the runner inside carries its own tab toolbar). Style it with\n`@pantoken/demo/demo.css`."
msgstr "Upodobi HTML panela demonstracije za razrešen demo: golo, v peskovniku (sandboxed), leno naloženo (lazy-loaded) iframe, oblikovano kot\nživ primer (brez lupine gostitelja — izvajalec znotraj nosi svojo vrstico z zavihki). Stiliraj ga z\n`@pantoken/demo/demo.css`."

#: tools/demo/src/functions/renderDemoFigure.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [ResolvedDemo](../interfaces/ResolvedDemo.md)."
msgstr "En [ResolvedDemo](../interfaces/ResolvedDemo.md)."

#: tools/demo/src/functions/renderDemoFigure.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The panel HTML string."
msgstr "Niz HTML-ja panela."

#: tools/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/demo` — the render side of the `@demo` system."
msgstr "`@pantoken/demo` — upodabljalni del sistema `@demo`."

#: tools/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/typedoc-plugin-demo` turns a `@demo <spec>` tag into a fenced `demo` block whose\nbody is the spec (a bare URL or a `<provider>:<ref>` pair). This package resolves that spec into an\nembeddable iframe and renders the surrounding panel — an MDN-style \"live sample.\""
msgstr "`@pantoken/typedoc-plugin-demo` turns a `@demo &lt;spec&gt;` tag into a fenced `demo` block whose\nbody is the spec (a bare URL or a `&lt;provider&gt;:&lt;ref&gt;` pair). This package resolves that spec into an\nembeddable iframe and renders the surrounding panel — an MDN-style \"live sample.\""

#: tools/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ships three things: [resolveDemo](functions/resolveDemo.md) (spec → iframe attributes, framework-agnostic), a\nmarkdown-it plugin ([demoMarkdownIt](functions/demoMarkdownIt.md)) that turns `demo` fences into the panel HTML, and a\nself-hosted runner (`@pantoken/demo/runner.html`) — a same-origin page that fetches a bare\nHTML/CSS/JS demo and renders it with your token stylesheets injected, so `self:` demos need no\nthird-party account and no framing workarounds."
msgstr "Vsebuje tri stvari: [resolveDemo](functions/resolveDemo.md) (spec → atributi iframe, neodvisno od ogrodja), a\nplugin za markdown-it ([demoMarkdownIt](functions/demoMarkdownIt.md)), ki spremeni ograje `demo` v HTML panela, in samostojni izvajalnik (`@pantoken/demo/runner.html`) — stran istega izvora, ki pridobi surov\nHTML/CSS/JS demo in ga upodobi z vbrizganimi slogovnimi listi vaših tokenov, zato `self:` demoji ne potrebujejo\nračuna tretje osebe niti obvodov za okvirjanje."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [demoMarkdownIt](../functions/demoMarkdownIt.md): the [resolveDemo](../functions/resolveDemo.md) fields plus optional live-example seaming."
msgstr "Možnosti za [demoMarkdownIt](../functions/demoMarkdownIt.md): polja iz [resolveDemo](../functions/resolveDemo.md) in opcijsko povezovanje živih primerov."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Site base path, e.g. `/pantoken/` (default `/`)."
msgstr "Osnovna pot spletnega mesta, npr. `/pantoken/` (privzeto `/`)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Runner page path, relative to `base` (default `play/index.html`)."
msgstr "Pot strani zaganjalnika, relativno glede na `base` (privzeto `play/index.html`)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Self-hosted demo-source dir, relative to `base` (default `demos/`)."
msgstr "Mapa z izvornimi datotekami demoja, gostovana lokalno, relativno glede na `base` (privzeto `demos/`)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stylesheet URLs the runner injects (into its chrome and every rendered result): the component\nsheets, the multi-theme token sheet, and the plugin/surface sheets. The runner themes by toggling\nthe `data-pantoken-theme` attribute, so one token sheet covers every theme."
msgstr "URL-ji slogovnih listov, ki jih zaganjalnik vgradi (v svojo lupino in v vsak upodobljen rezultat): listi komponent, več-tematski token list in listi vtičnikov/površin. Zaganjalnik preklaplja teme z atributom `data-pantoken-theme`, zato en token list pokriva vse teme."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When set, appends a live preview after each `html` fence on matching pages — the same markup,\nrendered live, beneath its source. Overlay examples (`<dialog>`, `[popover]`) are skipped: they're\nhidden until opened, so a `## Demo` iframe drives their preview instead."
msgstr "When set, appends a live preview after each `html` fence on matching pages — the same markup,\nrendered live, beneath its source. Overlay examples (`&lt;dialog&gt;`, `[popover]`) are skipped: they're\nhidden until opened, so a `## Demo` iframe drives their preview instead."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Route a `demo:self:<name>` fence to a locale-specific self-hosted demo directory, from the current\npage's markdown-it `env.relativePath` (e.g. `\"hu/\"` for pages under `hu/`, `\"\"` for the root\nlocale). Prepended to `demosPath` so the localized clone of a demo (translated prose, same markup)\nloads instead of the English source. Omit for a single-locale site."
msgstr "Route a `demo:self:&lt;name&gt;` fence to a locale-specific self-hosted demo directory, from the current\npage's markdown-it `env.relativePath` (e.g. `\"hu/\"` for pages under `hu/`, `\"\"` for the root\nlocale). Prepended to `demosPath` so the localized clone of a demo (translated prose, same markup)\nloads instead of the English source. Omit for a single-locale site."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ExampleSrcdocOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [buildExampleSrcdoc](../functions/buildExampleSrcdoc.md)."
msgstr "Možnosti za [buildExampleSrcdoc](../functions/buildExampleSrcdoc.md)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ExampleSrcdocOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stylesheet URLs to load into the iframe's `<head>` (tokens, components, utilities, icons, …)."
msgstr "Stylesheet URLs to load into the iframe's `&lt;head&gt;` (tokens, components, utilities, icons, …)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ExampleSrcdocOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap `html` in the shared `.instui-card` surface (default `true`)."
msgstr "Zavite `html` v skupno površino `.instui-card` (privzeto `true`)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ExampleSrcdocOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text direction for the isolated document's `<html>` (default `\"ltr\"`) — a srcdoc never inherits it from the embedding page."
msgstr "Text direction for the isolated document's `&lt;html&gt;` (default `\"ltr\"`) — a srcdoc never inherits it from the embedding page."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/LiveExampleOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "How to seam a live preview onto each `@example` HTML fence on matching pages."
msgstr "Kako na vsako HTML ograjo `@example` na ustreznih straneh pripeti predogled v živo."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/LiveExampleOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only wrap fences on pages whose markdown-it `env.relativePath` matches (e.g. the CSS-API pages)."
msgstr "Ograje obdelajte le na straneh, katerih markdown-it `env.relativePath` se ujema (npr. strani CSS-API)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/LiveExampleOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the preview block appended after each non-overlay `html` fence, from its markup, any `-flag` tokens parsed from the fence info string, and the page's `env.relativePath` (for locale/direction lookups)."
msgstr "Sestavite predogledni blok, pripojen za vsako ne-overlay `html` ograjo, iz njenega označevanja (markup), morebitnih `-flag` tokenov, razčlenjenih iz info niza ograje, in `env.relativePath` strani (za iskanje lokalizacije/smeri)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for resolving a demo spec. Only the `self` provider uses the runner/demos/css fields."
msgstr "Možnosti za razreševanje specifikacije demoja. Samo ponudnik `self` uporablja polja runner/demos/css."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolvedDemo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A resolved demo: iframe attributes plus the provider that produced them."
msgstr "Razrešen demo: atributi iframe in ponudnik, ki jih je ustvaril."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolvedDemo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The provider that produced the embed (`url`, `self`, `stackblitz`, …)."
msgstr "Ponudnik, ki je ustvaril vdelavo (`url`, `self`, `stackblitz`, …)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolvedDemo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The iframe `src`."
msgstr "Iframe `src`."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolvedDemo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The iframe `sandbox` attribute."
msgstr "Atribut iframe `sandbox`."

#: tools/demo/src/variables/FULLSCREEN_BUTTON_HTML.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A hoverable \"view fullscreen\" button, overlaid on a demo/example frame the same way VitePress's own\ncode-block \"copy\" button reveals on hover. Purely markup — wire a delegated click handler in your\nhost page (`button.closest(...).querySelector(\"iframe\")?.requestFullscreen()`; see the pantoken docs\ntheme for the reference wiring) and style the reveal-on-hover with `@pantoken/demo/demo.css`."
msgstr "Gumb, ki se ob premiku miške prikaže kot \"prikaži celozaslonsko\", prekrit nad okvirjem demonstracije/primera na enak način, kot se VitePressov gumb v bloku kode \"kopiraj\" razkrije ob premiku miške.\nPopolnoma označevalnik — povežite pooblaščenega obdelovalca klika na vaši gostiteljski strani (`button.closest(...).querySelector(\"iframe\")?.requestFullscreen()`; glejte temo pantoken docs za referenčno vezavo) in oblikujte prikaz-ob-premiku s `@pantoken/demo/demo.css`."

