#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "`.instui-button` — An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
#~ msgstr "`.instui-button` — dostopna kontrola dejanja, oblikovana iz palete tokenov; privzeto primarna."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "The AI variants layer two gradients — a padding-box fill and a border-box stroke — for their frame, and `-color-ai-secondary` can't paint gradient text and a fill at once, so its centre stays transparent at rest and fills on hover or active. `-without-background` hover and active derive a low-opacity, slightly-darkened brand wash rather than using the raw hover-background tokens, which would print same-colour-on-same-colour text. Also sets its own icon/label `gap` and horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. The optional `.instui-button-group` wrapper maps Figma's `.buttonGroup` and owns adjacent button spacing."
#~ msgstr "AI različice nanesejo dva gradienta — polnilo v padding-boxu in potezo v border-boxu — za svoj okvir, in `-color-ai-secondary` ne more istočasno narisati gradientnega besedila in polnila, zato je njegov center v mirovanju prosojen in se napolni ob hover ali active. Hover in active za `-without-background` izpeljeta nizko-opaciten, nekoliko potemnjen brand wash namesto uporabe surovih hover-background tokenov, ki bi besedilo naredili enake barve na enaki podlagi. Nastavi tudi svoj ikono/oznako `gap` in horizontalno `padding`; zaporedje modifierjev za razmik `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` pregazi te vgrajene vrednosti. Opcijski ovojnica `.instui-button-group` preslika Figma-ino `.buttonGroup` in ima v lasti razmik med sosednjimi gumbi."

