#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "Set `el.indeterminate = true` in JavaScript to show the mixed-state dash; the checked tick auto-contrasts against the fill — white on a dark fill, near-black on a light one. Also sets its own `gap` between the control and its label; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
#~ msgstr "Nastavite `el.indeterminate = true` v JavaScriptu, da prikažete črtico za mešano stanje; potrditvena kljukica samodejno kontrastira z ozadjem — bela na temnem polnilu, skoraj črna na svetlem. Prav tako nastavi svoj `gap` med kontrolko in njeno oznako; zaporedno dodajanje `-gap-*` utilitarnega modifikatorja za razmik pregazi to vgrajeno vrednost."

