#~ msgstr "`.instui-progress-circle` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Krožni indikator napredka, ki ga poganjata prilagojeni lastnosti `--value` in `--value-max`."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "The ring is a `conic-gradient` donut painted on `::before` and clipped with a radial-gradient mask; `--value` divided by `--value-max` drives the arc. Add `-should-animate` and load the interactions entry point to animate it from zero on mount. InstUI has no indeterminate state; `:indeterminate` is a pantoken-only best guess (native `<progress>` without a `value` attribute), spinning the ring at a fixed arc and hiding `.value` since there's no meaningful number to show. `<meter>` has no indeterminate state, so it's unaffected."
#~ msgstr "Obroč je `conic-gradient` „donut“ narisan na `::before` in zatemnjen z radialno-gradijentno masko; lok poganja razmerje `--value` deljeno z `--value-max`. Dodajte `-should-animate` in naložite vstopno točko interakcij, da ga animirate iz nič ob priklopu. InstUI nima nedoločene (indeterminate) države; `:indeterminate` je pantokenova najboljša ocena (nativni `<progress>` brez atributa `value`), ki vrti obroč pri fiksnem loku in skriva `.value`, saj ni smiselne številke za prikaz. `<meter>` nima nedoločene države, zato nanj to ne vpliva."

