#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "✅ Use Wrapper when:"
#~ msgstr "✅ Uporabite Wrapper, kadar:"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "- Building a full Canvas product page that needs a consistent layout shell\n- The page uses GlobalNav as the primary navigation anchor\n- The page needs side panels: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, or a UtilityPanel\n- You need consistent container padding and content max-width across the full page\n🚫 Don't use Wrapper when:"
#~ msgstr "- Gradite celotno stran izdelka Canvas, ki potrebuje konsistentno postavitev lupine\n- Stran uporablja GlobalNav kot glavni navigacijski sidro\n- Stran potrebuje stranske panele: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea ali UtilityPanel\n- Potrebujete enotno polnilo kontejnerja in največjo širino vsebine po celotni strani\n🚫 Ne uporabljajte Wrapper, kadar:"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "- Building a Modal, Tray, or Drawer — those have their own layout containers\n- Wrapping a sub-section of a page — Wrapper contains the full page, not a region"
#~ msgstr "- Gradite Modal, Tray ali Drawer — ti imajo svoje postavitvene kontejnere\n- Zavijate pododsek strani — Wrapper vsebuje celotno stran, ne regijo"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "- Map the main content area to a &lt;main&gt; landmark with a skip-nav link so keyboard users can bypass GlobalNav\n- Give ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" with a distinct aria-label such as \"Page navigation\" — separate from GlobalNav's landmark\n- Give TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" with a descriptive aria-label that reflects its content, such as \"Student details\"\n- Give each UtilityPanel a distinct aria-label: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", or \"Filters\"\n- When a UtilityPanel opens, move focus into the panel; when it closes, return focus to the trigger that opened it"
#~ msgstr "- Označite glavno vsebinsko območje z oznako &lt;main&gt; in povezavo za preskok, da lahko uporabniki na tipkovnici preskočijo GlobalNav\n- Dajte ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" z ločenim aria-label, na primer \"Page navigation\" — ločeno od GlobalNav-ovega znamenja\n- Dajte TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" z opisnim aria-labelom, ki odraža njegovo vsebino, na primer \"Student details\"\n- Dajte vsakemu UtilityPanelu ločen aria-label: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\" ali \"Filters\"\n- Ko se UtilityPanel odpre, premaknite fokus v panel; ko se zapre, vrnite fokus na sprožilec, ki ga je odprl"

