#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs."
#~ msgstr "Pendo vstri HTML vodnika v gostiteljsko stran; to upodobi DOM tega vodnika (`._pendo-*`), da se ujema z Instructure UI, pri čemer za poravnavo uporablja pantoken-ov sloj tokenov `--instui-*`. Vključuje odzivne oblike vodnikov z vijoličnimi in morsko obarvanimi pasicami ter opozorila, pojavna okna, ankete in kontrole. Komponentna CSS je prenesena iz `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken zagotavlja tokene in sestavo. Ena tematska razred, ki vsebuje `instui`, aktivira omejeno slogovno datoteko; kompaktni priponi na tem razredu izberejo barve pasic in glife."

